<title>SPAIN: VW Spain unit names De Smedt new chairman.</title>
<headline>VW Spain unit names De Smedt new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German carmaker Volkswagen AG's Spanish car unit Sociedad Espanola de Automoviles de Turismo SA (Seat) named on Wednesday Pierre Alain de Smedt its new chairman, a note from the company said.</p>
<p>De Smedt replaces chairman Juan Llorens at the end of the year.</p>
<p>Smedt has been chairman of Volkswagen in Brazil from 1992.</p>
<p>Llorens has served as Seat's chairman since 1993.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
